    {
      "id": "204",
      "type": "related_content",
      "attributes": {
        "id": 204,
        "relationship_type": "synonym",
        "body": "The particle まで has the core meaning of 'as far as.' With nouns, it can mean 'until' with time expressions (e.g. 月曜まで休む = 'take off until Monday') or 'up to' with locations (e.g. 駅まで送る = 'see [someone] off to the station'). When used after a plain-form verb, it means 'until A happens. For example, 友達が来るまでテレビを見ていた = 'I was watching TV until my friend came.'",
